  "text": "Feed\nFind People\nCommunity\nTraining\nIntegrations\nChat\nRoutes\n[профиль]\nGet the app to track runs and let your plan adapt to every workout.\nGet the app\nEASY RUN\nWednesday, November 4, 2026\n• 10.5 kilometers total\nCoach Notes\n\nHi [профиль]! You have an easy run today.\n\nYou’re still building your aerobic base, and today’s easy run is key for that. Keep your effort light and steady, and focus on running smoothly. These easier days are critical for your long-term success. Remember, it’s not about speed today—it’s about getting the mileage in while keeping your body fresh. Use this time to enjoy the simplicity of running and to connect with the joy it brings.\n\nRead More\nEASY RUN\n10.5 kilometers\n\nRun at a conversational pace no faster than 5:12 / kilometer.",
